43:["$","div",null,{"className":"divide-y divide-border border-y border-border","children":[["$","section","Agency handoff is often more important than first paint",{"id":"agency-handoff-is-often-more-important-than-first-paint","className":"scroll-mt-28 py-12 sm:py-14","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-[4rem_minmax(0,1fr)] md:gap-8","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-sm text-primary","children":"01"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-balance text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] sm:text-3xl","children":"Agency handoff is often more important than first paint"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-[1.05rem] leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Agency teams frequently evaluate generators by how reliably they get from draft to sign-off to deployment. Bolt and Squid both generate quickly, but Squid's extra emphasis is around evidentiary output around generation and checkpointed versioning that aligns with review workflows."}],"$undefined"]}]]}]}],["$","section","Predictable spending is part of project planning",{"id":"predictable-spending-is-part-of-project-planning","className":"scroll-mt-28 py-12 sm:py-14","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-[4rem_minmax(0,1fr)] md:gap-8","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-sm text-primary","children":"02"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-balance text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] sm:text-3xl","children":"Predictable spending is part of project planning"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-[1.05rem] leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Client estimates assume stable cost profiles. Squid publishes an expected estimate up front and records the final ledger, while Bolt's token cost can drift as project context grows. This shifts how you plan budgets in longer agency engagements."}],"$undefined"]}]]}]}],["$","section","Recovery behavior changes how fast agencies iterate",{"id":"recovery-behavior-changes-how-fast-agencies-iterate","className":"scroll-mt-28 py-12 sm:py-14","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-[4rem_minmax(0,1fr)] md:gap-8","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-sm text-primary","children":"03"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-balance text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] sm:text-3xl","children":"Recovery behavior changes how fast agencies iterate"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-[1.05rem] leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"For agencies, a bad revision is not the end of the project; it's a normal part of delivery. Squid keeps restore as a non-destructive checkpoint event so a clean path to previous state is visible and auditable. Bolt's history restoration is also strong; teams should inspect how it interacts with their internal release process."}],"$undefined"]}]]}]}],["$","section","Where Bolt can still be the better fit",{"id":"where-bolt-can-still-be-the-better-fit","className":"scroll-mt-28 py-12 sm:py-14","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-[4rem_minmax(0,1fr)] md:gap-8","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-sm text-primary","children":"04"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-balance text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] sm:text-3xl","children":"Where Bolt can still be the better fit"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-[1.05rem] leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"If your team needs Bolt-centric full-stack ecosystems, integrated hosting, and established Bolt-specific editor collaboration, it may be the right primary platform. Squid is strongest when the primary decision is a highly portable React output with a strong verification layer around export."}],"$undefined"]}]]}]}],"$L51"]}]
